    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "Required n8n environment variable:\nWIRO_N8N_SHARED_SECRET=<same value as Wiro N8N_WEBHOOK_SECRET>\n\nConnect each Switch output to the real business automation you want:\n\nlead.created -> notify ops, append lead sheet row, wait 6h, check status, follow up.\nestimate.requested -> quote follow-up and price-interest reporting.\nbooking.created -> booking confirmation checklist, prep email, calendar task.\nbooking.completed -> post-tour review request, upsell timer.\nreview.submitted -> approval queue and low-rating escalation.\nnewsletter.subscribed -> CRM tag and welcome sequence.\nabandoned.recovery_sent -> recovery reporting.\npost_tour_review.event_tracked -> low-rating escalation and review dashboard.\nwhatsapp.message_received -> intent triage, internal alert, CRM activity.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 420
      },
